4ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨鹰下有一熊","author":"刘崧","text":"当年渭水困鹰扬，兆入非熊鬓已霜。\n搏击只今誇健翮，可能兀立睨沧茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24989,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹禽墨戏","author":"刘崧","text":"南山无树起春风，寂寞林栖户牖空。\n枯竹横枝荆棘底，天寒愁杀白头翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24990,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同旷伯逵登揭氏山雨亭观石上虞太史刻字退池上观鱼而归","author":"刘崧","text":"太史文章汉魏初，碧苔深护九霞书。\n閒来倚石看云月，直恐神光贯紫虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24991,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同旷伯逵登揭氏山雨亭观石上虞太史刻字退池上观鱼而归","author":"刘崧","text":"高柳芳池滟滟春，一泓新绿净无尘。\n夜来忽涨西山雨，千尺苍波跃锦鳞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄易撝","author":"刘崧","text":"谷口同游最忆君，别来双雁不堪闻。\n满山橡栗何由拾，独拥寒扉望白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24993,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠万讱归清江定侯帅阃","author":"刘崧","text":"万郎风骨自清奇，解赴从军五字诗。\n却笑当年杜陵老，谩称骥子好男儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24994,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠万讱归清江定侯帅阃","author":"刘崧","text":"北沙亭上题诗处，五六年前共阿翁。\n乱后相逢浑不识，可怜玉树倚秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24995,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠万讱归清江定侯帅阃","author":"刘崧","text":"寂寞林居似耦耕，感君相顾足高情。\n茆堂昨夜听寒雨，竹火松烟坐到明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠万讱归清江定侯帅阃","author":"刘崧","text":"新筑土垣浑不高，旋编荻户隔蓬蒿。\n雨中惯着寻山屐，自过村南问浊醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠万讱归清江定侯帅阃","author":"刘崧","text":"子归帅阃慎驱驰，莫怪山人送别迟。\n记取池亭脩竹下，别馀长是看君诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜饮扁鹊观同魏炼师坐竹林下","author":"刘崧","text":"扁鹊观前清夜游，青衣隔竹送茶瓯。\n绿阴深巷凉如泻，坐听琼箫转玉楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":24999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题泰华春云图","author":"刘崧","text":"仙人楼观炫青红，帝子行春游太空。\n玉检金枢人不见，汉家坛墠雨云中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨补之临宋徽宗湖口鸂鶒图","author":"刘崧","text":"太湖石畔双鸂鶒，碧草春明绣羽毛。\n莫拟宣和看笔法，故宫花鸟属蓬蒿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25001,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题明皇行乐图","author":"刘崧","text":"宴罢微行禁苑春，谏臣已远弄臣亲。\n那知剑阁西巡路，能护銮舆有几人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25002,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨梅","author":"刘崧","text":"水边小树寻常见，不似横枝花更繁。\n乱后江南谁寄与，只将图画赏清樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25003,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]